msgid "Place HPF field"
msgstr "Tempatkan lapang pandang HPF"

#: src/actions.rs:399
msgid "This field extends past the slide edge; its area includes empty canvas."
msgstr ""
"Lapang pandang ini melewati tepi preparat; luasnya mencakup kanvas kosong."

