msgid ""
"The file does not say whether its coordinates are 2D or 3D (Annotation "
"Coordinate Type is missing)."
msgstr ""
"Berkas tidak menyebutkan apakah koordinatnya 2D atau 3D (Annotation "
"Coordinate Type tidak ada)."

#: src/formats/dicom/mod.rs:1109
msgid ""
"The file's coordinates are of an unknown type (\"{}\"); 2D annotations can "
"be imported."
msgstr ""
"Koordinat berkas memiliki jenis yang tidak dikenal (“{}”); anotasi 2D dapat "
"diimpor."

#: src/formats/dicom/mod.rs:1126
msgid ""
"The annotations' pixel coordinates are relative to single frames (tiles) of "
"the image (Pixel Origin Interpretation FRAME), which eov cannot place; "
"coordinates relative to the whole image (VOLUME) can be imported."
msgstr ""
"Koordinat piksel anotasi relatif terhadap bingkai tunggal (petak) gambar "
"(Pixel Origin Interpretation FRAME), yang tidak dapat ditempatkan oleh eov; "
"koordinat yang relatif terhadap seluruh gambar (VOLUME) dapat diimpor."

#: src/formats/dicom/mod.rs:1130
msgid ""
"Unknown pixel origin interpretation \"{}\"; coordinates are taken relative "
"to the whole image."
msgstr ""
"Interpretasi asal piksel “{}” tidak dikenal; koordinat dianggap relatif "
"terhadap seluruh gambar."

